$DATUM General Synthetic Procedures for II. To a solution of I (6 mmol) in
N,N-dimethylformamide (10 mL) was added potassium phthalimide (6 mmol) in
portions. After the mixture was stirred at room temperature for 5 h,
water (50 mL) was added, and the precipitate was collected by filtration
and washed with water. After recrystallization from ethanol, A white
crystal was obtained. II1. Yield, 86.3%; mp, 133- 135 °C. 1H NMR (CDCl3):
δ 4.87 (s, 2H, CH2), 7.41 (s, 3H, Ar-H), 7.67 (s, 1H, Ar-H), 7.72 (m, 2H,
Ar-H), 7.87 (m, 2H, Ar-H), 7.99 (s, 2H, Ar-H).
